# Resonant

You are working on Resonant, a listening app. Brand stays Resonant.

## Playback

- No skip / next UI. Media Session must not bind nexttrack / previoustrack as skip.
- `Queue.goToNext` and `goToPrevious` refuse. The engine chooses what follows.
- Dual play is forbidden: never Apple preview and a YouTube iframe together.
- Atlas `preview_url` must pause MiniPlayer.

## Surfaces

- Homepage still names Listen Now, Favorite Songs, Connect Apple Music.
- Ask lives at `/talk`.
- Stored catalog ontology has no genre field. Every Noise atlas is navigation only.

## Search and words

- Apple Music first, then Deezer. YouTube is official video / full listen, not the default catalog.
- Lyrics from lrclib only. Honour LRC `[offset:±ms]`. Never invent lyrics.
- Named-artist matching: «شبیه» is not the night room «شب». Keep digits (Zero 7 is not Zero).
- Do not dump NetEase / QQ / KuGou / Kuwo as in-app streams.

## MCP

- Nuclear MCP (`/mcp`, localhost:8800): four tools only (`list_methods`, `method_details`, `describe_type`, `call`). New capabilities go in Nuclear **domains** (Atlas, Drift, Taste, Wheat, Cognition).
- Full MCP (`/api/mcp`): drift cognition plus the same Ask tools (`find_music`, `browse_atlas`, `fetch_lyrics`, `research_recording`, `share_listen`, …).
- Harness, Vercel, Linear, Sentry, Notion, Slack, Exa, Braintrust are ops tools for this repo. Do not wire Aave, ads, or unrelated SaaS into the listener UI.
- `research_recording` cites Wikipedia / MusicBrainz. It is not lyrics.

## Design tokens

- Read `src/app/theme.css`, `src/app/variables.css`, `src/app/tokens.json`.
- Token **names** are locked. `--radius-buttons: 0px`. `--page-max-width: 1200px`.
- Do not switch fonts to Righteous/Poppins. Do not persist ui-ux-pro-max MASTER.md with new hex/fonts.
- Nested buttons are invalid. `CloseGlyph` stays exported from `src/components/cosmos/icons.tsx`.

## Previews

- Unique git: resonant-etg only. Never send music / music-bhdv Vercel URLs.
